  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "RAD-C01",
      "title": "Exact finite predicates are real mechanisms, conditional on admitted encodings.",
      "assessment": "Primary gates check declared rational matrix dimensions and d1*d0=0, L1 primal/dual feasibility and equality, and lexicographic tie witnesses. Valuation receipts recompute bounded integer weighted residual totals and disposition. run_swarm additionally binds candidate, epoch, ordered probes and weights, and binds the packet epoch at entry. This runtime closes the standalone zero-weight/epoch mismatch concern.",
