    {
      "id": "RAD-C02",
      "title": "The active PFP gateway contains substantive reservation and recovery checks.",
      "assessment": "PfpSeatGateway reserves the full configured output allowance before send, records reservation and settlement delta, validates matching settlement terms, and blocks later sends on unresolved outcomes. It checks nonnegative receipt costs/usage and binds replay provider bytes. These mechanisms are stronger than the separate legacy gateway and than treating an idempotency-key string alone as exactly-once dispatch.",
