    },
    {
      "id": "RAD-C03",
      "title": "Canonical records and exact prefix comparison provide useful local custody.",
      "assessment": "The stage codec closes record fields, normalizes semantic Unicode identity, validates selected bounds and binds record digests. complete_bout compares the entire retained DDC prefix before slicing appended steps. This is stronger than an equal-line-count mirror check.",
