    },
    {
      "id": "RAD-F06",
      "title": "Residual worsening can reset the no-progress counter.",
      "assessment": "run_swarm sets refined_residual=1 whenever post_residual differs from pre_residual. For residual1 to2, delta is positive and status HOLD, but progressed is true and scheduler dry_rounds resets. The oscillation detector also receives that positive progress signal.",
