      "assessment": "All815 raw lines read, including PDF byte writer and substantive retained tests. Deterministic MAM rendering prefers summary history then tape fallback; it retains blocked-turn mentions, truncates quotes with explicit ellipsis, escapes LaTeX/PDF delimiters and emits fixed-template MD/TEX/PDF without a renderer subprocess. PDF uses WinAnsi with unsupported characters replaced by ?, so it cannot preserve arbitrary mathematical/Unicode text; full narrative/source bytes remain the reference. Long unbroken words are not split to fit width. Captured summary presence skips tape parsing; this is retelling, not cross-artifact validation. Missing text is narrated as blocked even absent an explicit refusal. Tests check ordering, blocked status, determinism, xref offsets and pagination but not complete PDF semantics; not executed. Explicit not-evidence footer is appropriate.",
