      "assessment": "Complete788-line active PFP gateway prefix plus exact template. Unlike frozen legacy gateway, it reads/reconciles reservations, writes a full-output estimate hold before send, retains unknown outcomes and raw received bytes, blocks unresolved holds across the account, accepts actual nonnegative receipt cost only, validates nonnegative u64 token usage and charges settlement delta=actual-hold. Known costly malformed replies retain at least their hold/known overrun and stop fallback; missing usage stops later model roles in that bout. Actual budget overrun is fully charged and refused after the call, not prevented by an estimate. Replay binds current request/config/bout/route, provider container bytes/cost, PFP content and checked envelope; mathematical candidate checkers remain downstream and evidence_grade is UNVERIFIED. Correctness assumes a trusted single-writer ledger: recover/read/admit/append is not an atomic cross-process reservation, and records are not signed here. PreparedTaskTurn and concrete transport/strict-json implementations are external dependencies, separately reviewed where available; no provider/replay executed.",
