      "assessment": "All437 raw lines read. Paid send requires positive ceiling and a quoted request before HTTP; response bytes are persisted before typed parsing, with conflicting names retried under a16-hex digest suffix. Quote uses body bytes+4096, advisor allowances, cache multiplier and declared code fee, not a proved tokenizer/provider/image/server-execution upper bound. Sibling name can exceed the raw store200-character cap after a valid long original name, and persistence failure after a call yields OutcomeUnknown. Unknown billing fields decline metering, leaving quote settlement to callers; model prices follow the request model without response identity enforcement. Non-2xx and truncated/partial captures are preserved where available. Bottom fabricated Ok/Err tests do not exercise transport. No HTTP or credentials accessed.",
