      "assessment": "Complete438-line prefix plus exact template. Skill-run writer distinguishes caller-authored narrative from captured contributions and persists raw checker receipt bytes/digest plus verdict-shaped metadata. PASS_TO_MASTER requires a parsed Accepted receipt, REFUSE with receipt requires Rejected; other statuses may omit receipts. No matching objective/task/candidate/checker invocation is established by this owner, so an unrelated self-authored Accepted receipt can satisfy its local gate unless caller/checker bindings are supplied elsewhere. parse_actions accepts object rows and checks letter only when present; persistence accepts dda_steps separately without calling that parser. Current reporting adds custody, not replay or authority. No writing/checker execution.",
