      "review_level": "full_owner_prefix_plus_exact_pinned_template_and_complete_residual_review",
      "assessment": "Complete483-line prefix plus exact template. run_swarm binds packet epoch at entry and evaluator candidate/epoch/probes/weights before accepting arithmetic, closing the standalone receipt gap. It consumes injected proposal/evaluation, bounded scheduler and optional sinks; there is no provider work in this review. Residual-refined counter increments whenever any residual changes, including increases, so a worsening valuation can reset dry-round accounting. Continuation halt ignores supplied reason/remaining budget and marks any nonempty result history COMPLETED. Model proposal precedes missing evaluator/epoch checks, and events/rollback may occur before local state/result commit; sink errors are not atomic rollback. Runtime receipt labels definition/profile supplied separately from scheduler without a direct identity crosscheck here; deterministic replay can detect inconsistent bindings later. Trust domain uses first assignment for scene, not the producing agent lookup. No global task-correctness guarantee.",
