      "assessment": "Complete384-line prefix plus exact template. Concrete N=1 scheduler validates definition/profile/graph/catalog identity, required operation coverage and declared independent-seat agent-ID disjointness. It does not resolve license digests or match required colours, and agent-ID distinction is weaker than independent provider/control. Step cost is exactly one unit; bounded steps/dry rounds/visits ensure a finite run for validated records. advance checks current scene but omits membership of result.status in SceneSpec.allowed_result_statuses and does not bind result agent to assigned seats. A terminal scene becomes COMPLETED for any non-stop result, including HOLD if stop statuses omit it. Transitions use first sorted matching priority; residual filters are any-match. Replay reuses the same scheduler, not an independent implementation. Direct call state/profile validity remains caller premise.",
