      "assessment": "All162 raw lines read. Deterministic synthetic diagnostic hashes text to a32-bit RNG seed, perturbs real Gaussian vectors, forms a normalized mixture of outer products and delegates density/spectrum validity to linear-algebra owners. Dimension guard1..128 and iteration policy100000 bound the declared numerical problem, while tolerances define entropy/nonzero thresholds. It measures this constructed synthetic state, not textual truth, physical quantum state or task fitness. Normalization and positive mixture have a clear conditional PSD/trace-one basis; actual numerical success depends on unexecuted linear-algebra dependencies. Failures become UNAVAILABLE/ArithmeticError; stream compatibility label lacks a fresh cross-language check. Bottom Ok/Err test does not exercise the diagnostic or prove six killed mutations.",
